Subject: [PATCH] The follower drawn a little further behind the player
 (SDK_PORT_3DS)

A tile behind the player, the follower's picture (a tile and more wide)
sat right on the player's back. It's drawn 3/16 of a tile further from
the player than its tile, along the line from the player to it (round a
corner with it), and its round shadow with it; less when it's nearer
than a tile (coming out of its ball), none within half a tile. Only
where it's drawn: its tile, and what it bumps into, are as ever.
---
